# f4-ej25: written by tools/cycles scenarios. Cycle table grid: ignition-off holds at throttle 0 and 1.
# Each hold is 0.5 s of settling and at least 24 whole cycles; 0.25 s sweeps join the holds.
# The renderer reads cut RPM THROTTLE SECONDS as a hold with the ignition off. snarl does not read these files.
hold 830 0 0.5
cut 830 0 4
sweep 830 1750 0 0.25
hold 1750 0 0.5
cut 1750 0 2.2
sweep 1750 2750 0 0.25
hold 2750 0 0.5
cut 2750 0 1.6
sweep 2750 3750 0 0.25
hold 3750 0 0.5
cut 3750 0 1.5
sweep 3750 4750 0 0.25
hold 4750 0 0.5
cut 4750 0 1.5
sweep 4750 5750 0 0.25
hold 5750 0 0.5
cut 5750 0 1.5
sweep 5750 6400 0 0.25
hold 6400 0 0.5
cut 6400 0 1.5
sweep 6400 830 1 0.25
hold 830 1 0.5
cut 830 1 4
sweep 830 1750 1 0.25
hold 1750 1 0.5
cut 1750 1 2.2
sweep 1750 2750 1 0.25
hold 2750 1 0.5
cut 2750 1 1.6
sweep 2750 3750 1 0.25
hold 3750 1 0.5
cut 3750 1 1.5
sweep 3750 4750 1 0.25
hold 4750 1 0.5
cut 4750 1 1.5
sweep 4750 5750 1 0.25
hold 5750 1 0.5
cut 5750 1 1.5
sweep 5750 6400 1 0.25
hold 6400 1 0.5
cut 6400 1 1.5
